┌── Log ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│           Three years after the Ash Peace.                                                       │
│                                                                                                  │
│           The war is won. The soldiers who won it were never paid.                               │
│                                                                                                  │
│           In the Thornmarch, a long way from any court, an exile chops wood.                     │
│                                                                                                  │
│           Dawn, in the yard behind a rented house. Two practice swords crack together, wood on   │
│           wood, as they have every morning for four years.                                       │
│                                                                                                  │
│           Hollis Marr                                                                            │
│           Guard up, Veyne. Higher. It drops when you're tired. Don't let it.                     │
│                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
│           Ellery                                                                                 │
│           Again.                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
│ ▶         Three strokes. On the fourth, the old man's sword is lying in the dirt between them.   │
│                                                                                                  │
│           Hollis Marr                                                                            │
│           ...Good. That's good. Four years I've been waiting for you to do that.                 │
│                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
│           Hollis Marr                                                                            │
│           Leave it where it is. Sit down, kid. There's something in my coat that I've spent all  │
│           morning not giving you.                                                                │
│                                                                                                  │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── wasd move · j go to this line · k close ──┘
